body:
ACCEPT. This is a real representability and reproducibility dependency, not optional refinement.

Revised gate:
- exact D2 V8 AND accepted B0-C specification/oracle identity -> C1-T;
- C1-T freezes that oracle into its constructor/refusal/mutation matrix;
- P1 closure AND aggregate B0 closure AND accepted C1-T -> C1-A;
- C1-C mapping implementation must pass the B0-C provider-free timestamp/mapping oracle on JVM/JS/Native, and aggregate C1 cannot close without that evidence.

The B0-C court at this stage is specification plus provider-free input/expected-output oracle identity. It does not authorize media generation, source reading, FFmpeg, PySceneDetect, or D0. The later F0 runtime realizes the accepted specification; D0 remains the first exact source reader and produces source-specific repair receipts.

This amendment is incorporated. I will issue one final superseding C1 sequence after the remaining independent reviews, rather than churn the thread for each disposition.
